\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Rudy Giuliani\uc2  and Dominion settle $1.3bn defamation suit over election lies\b0\par\par\uc2 Richard Luscombe \par \uc2 575 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 September 2025\par 14:04 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 US voting machine maker sued ex-New York mayor and Trump lawyer in 2021 for repeatedly calling election rigged\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/rudygiuliani"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rudy Giuliani}}}\uc2 , the former New York mayor and personal lawyer to Donald Trump, has settled a long-running defamation lawsuit with \uc2 Dominion Voting Systems\uc2  over lies he told about the result of the 2020 presidential election.\par \par \uc2 Details of the settlement, revealed in federal court in Washington DC in a filing late on Friday, are confidential. The Colorado-based voting machine manufacturer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/jan/25/dominion-rudy-giuliani-lawsuit-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sued Giuliani for $1.3bn}}}\uc2  in 2021, citing more than 50 instances in which he made false or defamatory statements insisting the election was rigged against Trump, with the integrity of Dominion\u8217\'20\'19s machinery at the heart of the conspiracy theory.\par \par \uc2 Representatives for Giuliani and Dominion confirmed the resolution on Saturday but declined further comment when approached {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/dominion-voting-systems-rudy-guiliani-reach-settlement-defamation-lawsuit/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by CBS News}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThe parties have agreed to a confidential settlement to this matter,\u8221\'20\'1D a Dominion spokesperson said in a short statement.\par \par \uc2 It is Dominion\u8217\'20\'19s third payout in defamation lawsuits about the election resolved before reaching trial. The company reached a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/18/fox-dominion-settle-us-defamation-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $787.5m settlement in 2023}}}\uc2  with Fox, the network that amplified numerous voices pushing the election lies, including the star\u8217\'20\'19s then-star host \uc2 Tucker Carlson\uc2 , the rightwing personality {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/media/2023/oct/31/tucker-carlson-fox-news-book-brian-stelter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 who was later fired}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The conservative outlet \uc2 Newsmax\uc2  in August {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/18/newsmax-election-lies-dominion-settlement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 agreed to pay $67m}}}\uc2  after a superior court judge in Delaware ruled it had defamed Dominion. \uc2 Newsmax\uc2  admitted no wrongdoing and said it stood by its reporting in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newsmax.com/newsfront/newsmax-settlement-dominion/2025/08/18/id/1222903/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 terse statement}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 but chose to settle before a jury got to decide the amount of damages in the $1.6bn lawsuit.\par \par \uc2 All three lawsuits related to evidence-free claims pushed by conservatives in the aftermath of the 2020 election that Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s victory over Trump was rigged \u8211\'20\'13 and that Dominion\u8217\'20\'19s machines were easily manipulated to provide false results.\par \par \uc2 As Trump\u8217\'20\'19s personal lawyer, Giuliani was a leading purveyor of the lies, appearing on television and radio shows as well as podcasts to amplify them.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDominion brings this action to set the record straight, to vindicate the company\u8217\'20\'19s rights under civil law, to recover compensatory and punitive damages, and to stand up for itself, its employees, and the electoral process,\u8221\'20\'1D the complaint against him stated.\par \par \uc2 Giuliani remained defiant at the time, stating he would countersue and insisting he was \u8220\'20\'1Cexercising my right of free speech and defending my client\u8221\'20\'1D. But his involvement ultimately proved costly, professionally and personally.\par \par \uc2 In July 2024, he was permanently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/02/rudy-giuliani-disbarred-new-york-2020-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disbarred from practicing law}}}\uc2  in the state of New York after earlier having his license suspended for his efforts to overturn the 2020 election. Three months later, he was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/26/rudy-giuliani-disbarred-washington-dc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disbarred in Washington DC}}}\uc2  after failing to respond to a demand to explain his actions.\par \par \uc2 This past November, he lost his temper in a New York court room and shouted: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/26/rudy-giuliani-court-hearing-bills"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI can\u8217\'20\'19t pay my bills\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  at a judge in a hearing to explore why he had not complied with orders to surrender assets to pay a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/22/rudy-giuliani-defamation-georgia-election-assets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $148m settlement}}}\uc2  to two Georgia election workers he defamed.\par \par \uc2 His outburst came weeks after he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/05/rudy-giuliani-defamation-georgia-election-workers-mercedes-benz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showed up to vote}}}\uc2  in Florida in the 2024 presidential election that resulted in a second presidency for Trump. Giuliani at the time was in a \uc2 Mercedes-Benz\uc2  the court had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/16/rudy-giuliani-property-election-workers-defamation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ordered him to hand over}}}\uc2  to the poll workers, Ruby Freeman and her daughter Shaye Moss.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250928el9s002e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
