\par\par \b \uc2 Wegovy maker \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2  to cut 9,000 jobs amid increased competition\b0\par\par\uc2 Julia Kollewe and Mark Sweney \par \uc2 770 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 September 2025\par 14:36 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Danish manufacturer of weight-loss and diabetes drugs under pressure from US rival Eli Lilly Business live \u8211\'20\'13 latest news\par \par \uc2 The Danish maker of the weight-loss and diabetes drugs Wegovy and Ozempic is to cut 9,000 jobs as it slashed its profit forecast again, amid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/06/sales-of-novo-nordisk-diabetes-drugs-including-ozempic-slow-sharply"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fierce competition}}}\uc2  from its US rival \uc2 Eli Lilly\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s decision to cut 11% of its global workforce of 78,400 is an attempt by the new chief executive, Mike Doustdar, to revive its fortunes.\par \par \uc2 Sales of its blockbuster injection Wegovy have slowed sharply as it has lost ground to \uc2 Eli Lilly\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Mounjaro jabs, as well as cheaper versions by generic drugmakers, while the pharmaceutical sector faces the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/06/stocks-shares-european-drug-companies-three-month-low-trump-tariffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 threat of targeted US tariffs}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The drugmaker said that 5,000 of the job losses would be in its home country of Denmark. The share price rose by 2.1% by Wednesday afternoon as investors were cheered by the cost savings\par \par \uc2 Booming sales of GLP-1 diabetes and obesity drugs in recent years had helped \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2  rise to become {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2023/sep/05/weight-loss-novo-nordisk-wegovy-uk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Europe\u8217\'20\'19s most valuable company}}}\uc2 , but it lost the title in March, only briefly regaining it in June.\par \par \uc2 Studies have shown that \uc2 Eli Lilly\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/may/13/the-toxic-debate-about-obesity-rages-on-but-at-least-we-know-if-mounjaro-or-wegovy-is-better-for-weight-loss"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mounjaro is more effective than Wegovy}}}\uc2  in reducing weight. Both can be prescribed by \uc2 NHS\uc2  doctors to patients with high clinical need. \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Ozempic injection is also available on the \uc2 NHS\uc2 , as a treatment for type 2 diabetes. It can be prescribed by private doctors \u8220\'20\'1Coff label\u8221\'20\'1D for weight loss.\par \par \uc2 The drugmaker estimates that the job cuts will save it 8bn kroner (\u163\'00\'A3930m) a year by 2026. However, they will cost 8bn kroner in one-off restructuring charges, prompting the company to cut its operating profit growth forecast for 2025 from 10%-16% to 4%-10%.\par \par \uc2 They are the first major move by Doustdar, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.novonordisk.com/news-and-media/latest-news/meet-mike-doustdar.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an Iranian-born Austrian-American businessman}}}\uc2  who took over last month from \uc2 Lars Fruergaard J\u248\'00\'F8rgensen\uc2 , who had led the company since 2017 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/06/sales-of-novo-nordisk-diabetes-drugs-including-ozempic-slow-sharply"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hinted at redundancies}}}\uc2  last month.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is always difficult to see talented and valued colleagues go, but we are convinced that this is the right thing to do for the long-term success of \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Doustdar said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need a shift in our mindset and approach so that we can be faster and more agile.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2  has also had disappointing results for its new obesity drug, CagriSema, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/business/healthcare-pharmaceuticals/novo-nordisk-says-trial-with-next-gen-obesity-drug-diabetics-shows-157-weight-2025-03-10/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 failed to outperform Eli Lilly\u8217\'20\'19s Mounjaro}}}\uc2  in weight loss in a late-stage clinical trial.\par \par \uc2 Sales have also been damaged by \u8220\'20\'1Ccompounding\u8221\'20\'1D in the US, where pharmacies make up weight-loss medications from ingredients, a practice that was allowed during drug shortages but was officially ended by the US regulator recently.\par \par \uc2 J\u248\'00\'F8rgensen said last month that the generic, copycat market had \u8220\'20\'1Cequal size to our business\u8221\'20\'1D and that compounded versions of Wegovy were sold at a \u8220\'20\'1Cmuch lower price point\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Bank of America\uc2  analysts said they now expect \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2  to issue a fourth profit warning when it reports third-quarter results in November, doubting the company can meet the top end of its sales forecast.\par \par \uc2 Along with other European pharmaceutical firms, \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2  also faces repeated threats from \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  to impose sector-specific tariffs on imports from drugmakers that do not move some of their production to the US.\par \par \uc2 Susannah Streeter, a \uc2 Hargreaves Lansdown\uc2  analyst, said: \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2 , which had grown fat on the spoils of its weight loss drugs, has been feeling the effects of rivals marching into the space. Uncertainty over American tariffs has also been a risk that continues to cast a shadow over the industry. By becoming a leaner machine, Novo hopes to redirect more funding to R&D to bolster its pipeline of products.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Over the past five years, \uc2 Novo Nordisk\uc2  went on a hiring spree, raising employee numbers by 75% as its performance soared because of the global popularity of its weight-loss drugs, which users inject themselves with once a week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/28/weight-loss-drug-mounjaro-uk-price-rise-eli-lilly-pauses-shipments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Eli Lilly paused UK orders}}}\uc2  for Mounjaro last month before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/14/eli-lilly-uk-price-weight-loss-jab-mounjaro-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hefty price rises}}}\uc2  across all doses from 1 September, to prevent inappropriate stockpiling of medicines, it said.\par \par \uc2 It increased the UK list price by up to 170% depending on the dose, although a discount to suppliers has been secured that should limit the impact on consumers, amid a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/14/eli-lilly-uk-price-weight-loss-jab-mounjaro-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 White House push}}}\uc2  to get drugmakers to raise prices in Europe to enable them to cut high US prices.\par \par \uc2 Mounjaro users were dismayed at the news, worried they would be unable to continue with the medication.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250910el9a001p6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
