\par\par \b \uc2 Hundreds of staff at California national parks to unionize amid Trump turmoil\b0\par\par\uc2 Dani Anguiano \par \uc2 563 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 September 2025\par 08:34 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 More than 97% at Yosemite and Sequoia & Kings Canyon parks voted to unionize as president enacts major cuts\par \par \uc2 Hundreds of staff at two of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/california"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 California}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s most popular {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/national-parks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 national parks}}}\uc2  have voted to unionize, a move that comes during a troubled summer for the \uc2 National Park Service\uc2 , which has seen the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  enact {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/22/montana-glacier-national-park-trump-cuts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unprecedented}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/07/us-national-parks-trump-cuts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 staff and budget cuts}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In an election held between July and August, more than 97% of workers at Yosemite and Sequoia & Kings Canyon national parks voted in support of organizing a union, according to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nffe.org/press-release/workers-at-yosemite-sequoia-kings-canyon-national-parks-organize-a-union-under-nffe/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  from the National Federation of Federal Employees. The \uc2 Federal Labor Relations Authority\uc2  certified the results last week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI am honored to welcome the Interpretive Park Rangers, scientists, biologists, photographers, geographers, and so many other federal employees in essential roles at both Yosemite and Sequoia & Kings Canyon to our union,\u8221\'20\'1D said Randy Erwin, the NFFE national president.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBy unionizing, hundreds of previously unrepresented employees have obtained a critical voice in their workplace and now have the power to make significant changes to benefit themselves and their colleagues.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The vote means 600 workers at the parks, including park rangers, researchers, educators, fee collectors and first responders, among others, will be represented by the National Federation of Federal Employees (NFFE).\par \par \uc2 Labor organizers have been trying to form a union at the parks for years but did not have the necessary support until this year when the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/15/us-forest-service-national-park-service-layoffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mass firings}}}\uc2  left the parks service in turmoil, the \uc2 Los Angeles Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.latimes.com/environment/story/2025-09-01/yosemite-sequoia-national-parks-workers-unionize"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt comes as no surprise workers in the \uc2 National Park Service\uc2  are overwhelmingly in favor of unionizing, as federal employees across the country have been faced with reductions in force, threats to workplace protections, and slashed agency budgets under this administration,\u8221\'20\'1D Erwin said.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2025/may/28/us-national-parks-trumps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Turmoil, resignations and \u8216\'20\'18psychological warfare\u8217\'20\'19: how Trump is crippling US national parks }}}\par \par \uc2 Since Trump took office this year the \uc2 National Park Service\uc2 , which manages 85m acres (34m hectares) of America\u8217\'20\'19s public lands, has lost a quarter of its permanent staff, seasonal hiring is down and the administration is seeking to slash more than $1bn from the NPS budget.\par \par \uc2 The US interior secretary, \uc2 Doug Burgum\uc2 , has said the cuts were \u8220\'20\'1Cclearing out the barn\u8221\'20\'1D. Despite the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2025/may/28/us-national-parks-trumps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upheaval}}}\uc2 , the federal government has ordered parks to stay open to the public. That has left staffers scrambling to manage the parks amid the peak summer season, and, as the Guardian reported {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/07/us-national-parks-trump-cuts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 last month}}}\uc2 , archeologists are managing ticket booths while park superintendents have cleaned bathrooms.\par \par \uc2 At Yosemite, scientists were also cleaning public bathrooms because there were no other workers to do it. Amid the turmoil this year, \uc2 NPS\uc2  employees {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2025/may/28/us-national-parks-trumps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Guardian}}}\uc2  earlier this summer they had received unsigned emails from the office of personnel management urging them to resign and find a job in the private sector.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEvery day you come to work and you have no idea what is going to happen next. It\u8217\'20\'19s like we are all being subjected to psychological warfare,\u8221\'20\'1D a staffer said this spring.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this year at Yosemite, laid-off employees {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sfchronicle.com/outdoors/article/yosemite-protest-job-cuts-20180229.php"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hung a US flag upside down}}}\uc2 , a symbol of distress, at the park\u8217\'20\'19s El Capitan to bring attention the cuts.\par \par \uc2 Erwin with the NFFE said the union would take \u8220\'20\'1Cevery step possible\u8221\'20\'1D to increase staffing and resources, and defend employees.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250902el920060q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
