\par\par \b \uc2 Pentagon asks civilian employees to join \u8216\'20\'18volunteer force\u8217\'20\'19 to aid Ice deportations\b0\par\par\uc2 Joseph Gedeon and Kira Lerner in Washington \par \uc2 659 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 August 2025\par 16:46 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Selected employees will join Trump\u8217\'20\'19s mass deportation campaign and \u8216\'20\'18offer critical support\u8217\'20\'19 to Ice operations\par \par \uc2 The Pentagon is recruiting civilian employees to join {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/02/immigration-trump-big-beautiful-bill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mass deportation campaign}}}\uc2  and asking staff to sign up for deployments to immigration enforcement facilities across the United States.\par \par \uc2 The defense department has posted a job listing requesting volunteers for civilian federal employees apply to join a \u8220\'20\'1Cvolunteer force\u8221\'20\'1D supporting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ice-us-immigration-and-customs-enforcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Immigration and Customs Enforcement (Ice)}}}\uc2  and Customs and Border Protection (CBP) operations. On Wednesday, the department reportedly emailed civilian employees asking them to take up this opportunity.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Secretary of Defense has authorized DoD civilian employees to participate in details to the \uc2 Department of Homeland Security\uc2  to contribute to its operations along the Southern Border and its internal immigration enforcement activities,\u8221\'20\'1D reads the email, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.404media.co/pentagon-asks-its-civilian-employees-if-they-want-to-work-for-ice/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 obtained by 404Media}}}\uc2 . Roughly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dodciviliancareers.com/whoweare/dod-employers?ref=404media.co"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 950,000 civilian employees}}}\uc2  work for the Pentagon.\par \par \uc2 Selected employees will reportedly \u8220\'20\'1Coffer critical support\u8221\'20\'1D to Ice and the border patrol \u8220\'20\'1Cas they fulfill the President\u8217\'20\'19s intent to ensure a safe and orderly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/usimmigration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 immigration}}}\uc2  system\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 A US defense official confirmed the initiative, telling the Guardian:\u8220\'20\'1CThe Secretary of Defense memorandum signed on Jun 1, 2025, \u8216\'20\'18Detailing of Department of Defense Civilians Employees to Support the \uc2 Department of Homeland Security\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 allows DoD civilians employees to participate in a detail for up to 180-days, supporting the \uc2 Department of Homeland Security\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s operations on the southern border.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The official said volunteer duties may include \u8220\'20\'1Cdata entry, operational planning support, processing and throughput logistics, and logistical support\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The job posting warns deployment locations \u8220\'20\'1Care not negotiable\u8221\'20\'1D and conditions \u8220\'20\'1Ccould be austere\u8221\'20\'1D. Assignments last up to 180 days at facilities along the border and throughout the US interior, and detailing means the staff keeps their salary and benefits.\par \par \uc2 The recruitment effort stems from a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://media.defense.gov/2025/Jun/02/2003730868/-1/-1/0/DETAILING-OF-DEPARTMENT-OF-DEFENSE-CIVILIAN-EMPLOYEES-TO-SUPPORT-THE-DEPARTMENT-OF-HOMELAND-SECURITY.PDF"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June memorandum }}}\uc2 issued by the defense secretary, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/pete-hegseth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pete Hegseth}}}\uc2 , that authorizes the civilian employee deployments \u8220\'20\'1Cin support of the President\u8217\'20\'19s priority of securing our borders\u8221\'20\'1D. The memo specifically enables both reimbursable and non-reimbursable details to DHS for southern border operations and \u8220\'20\'1Cinternal immigration enforcement\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The Pentagon initiative comes as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  works to expand immigration enforcement personnel, infrastructure and operations across the country. The Big Beautiful Bill Act, signed by Trump last month, includes budget for an additional 10,000 Ice agents, and Ice is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/08/20/ice-recruitment-military-bonuses-00516709"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly}}}\uc2  offering signing bonuses of up to $50,000 and has reduced its age requirements in an effort to expand its forces.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, the \uc2 Washington Post\uc2  reported that DHS had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/climate-environment/2025/08/06/fema-ice-mass-deportations-dhs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reassigned}}}\uc2  dozens of \uc2 Federal Emergency Management Agency\uc2  (Fema) employees to Ice.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, new detention facilities are being established in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/immigration/2025/08/20/nebraska-cornhusker-clink-ice-detention-center/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nebraska}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/14/florida-governor-ron-desantis-immigration-detention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Florida}}}\uc2  and at military installations{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/immigration/2025/08/07/trump-fort-bliss-migrants-detention/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  including Fort Bliss}}}\uc2  in Texas, which now houses migrants in tent structures with capacity for 5,000 people.\par \par \uc2 Ice arrests have surged nationwide, with northern California {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sfchronicle.com/bayarea/article/ice-arrests-deport-data-20818148.php"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seeing a 123% increase}}}\uc2  in detentions between January and July compared to late 2024.\par \par \uc2 The administration has also begun deploying Ice agents alongside local police for routine traffic enforcement. In Washington DC, federal immigration agents now accompany police officers during moped traffic stops targeting food delivery drivers, most of whom are from Central or South America, according to reporting from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/dc-md-va/2025/08/21/dc-police-ice-moped-crackdown-delivery-drivers/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Washington Post}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The DHS secretary, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kristi-noem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kristi Noem}}}\uc2 , announced last week that approximately 1.6 million undocumented immigrants had left the US during her first 200 days in office, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dhs.gov/news/2025/08/14/secretary-noem-announces-16-million-illegal-aliens-have-left-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 citing agency data}}}\uc2 . There is also a planned $20-50m ad buy dubbed \u8220\'20\'1C{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apfs-cloud.dhs.gov/record/71108/public-print/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stronger Border, Stronger America}}}\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D to promote the work of the DHS set to launch in September.\par \par \uc2 The salary range for the volunteer positions spans from approximately $25,684 to $191,900 annually, with assignments requiring 76% or greater travel and no remote work options available, according to the job listing. Relocation expenses will not be reimbursed.\par \par \uc2 The Pentagon declined to specify how many civilian employees are expected to participate in the program.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250821el8l00565\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
