\par\par \b \uc2 Trump news at a glance: \u8216\'20\'18credibility\u8217\'20\'19 of US economics data at risk, say experts, as president fires labor official\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff \par \uc2 973 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 August 2025\par 00:57 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s own former statistics chief denounces move as \u8216\'20\'18groundless\u8217\'20\'19 and \u8216\'20\'18dangerous\u8217\'20\'19. Key US politics stories from Friday 1 August at a glance\par \par \uc2 After {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  ordered the firing of a federal government official in charge of labor statistics, experts and opposition politicians have expressed alarm that the \u8220\'20\'1Ccredibility\u8221\'20\'1D of US economic data was at risk.\par \par \uc2 The US president claimed without evidence that Erika McEntarfer, the commissioner of labor statistics, had \u8220\'20\'1Crigged\u8221\'20\'1D job numbers \u8220\'20\'1Cin order to make the Republicans, and ME, look bad\u8221\'20\'1D, after data showed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/01/jobs-report-july-trump-tariffs-trade-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jobs growth stalled}}}\uc2  this summer, prompting accusations that the president was \u8220\'20\'1Cfiring the messenger\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Bill Beach, a former Heritage Foundation economist who was picked by Trump in 2018 to oversee labor statistics, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/BeachWW453/status/1951376029060055506"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denounced}}}\uc2  what he called the \u8220\'20\'1Ctotally groundless firing\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPoliticizing economic statistics is a self-defeating act,\u8221\'20\'1D said \uc2 Michael Madowitz\uc2 , the principal economist at the Roosevelt Institute\u8217\'20\'19s Roosevelt Forward, who added that \u8220\'20\'1Ccredibility is far easier to lose than rebuild, and the credibility of America\u8217\'20\'19s economic data is the foundation on which we\u8217\'20\'19ve built the strongest economy in the world\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Senate Democrat \uc2 Ron Wyden\uc2  said \u8220\'20\'1Cthis is the act of somebody who is soft, weak and afraid to own up to the reality of the damage his chaos is inflicting on our economy\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The move came as markets around the world were roiled by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s latest tariff announcement, which left more than 60 countries scrambling to secure trade deals.\par \par \uc2 Here are the key US politics stories of the day:\par \par \uc2 Trump orders firing of jobs report official after hiring slows\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  ordered the firing of the federal government official in charge of labor statistics, hours after data revealed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/01/jobs-report-july-trump-tariffs-trade-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jobs growth stalled}}}\uc2  this summer, prompting accusations that he was \u8220\'20\'1Cfiring the messenger\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The US president claimed that Erika McEntarfer, the commissioner of labor statistics, had \u8220\'20\'1Cfaked\u8221\'20\'1D employment figures in the run-up to last year\u8217\'20\'19s election in an effort to boost \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s chances of victory.\par \par \uc2 Trump later {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/114955222046259464"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claimed}}}\uc2 : \u8220\'20\'1CToday\u8217\'20\'19s Jobs Numbers were RIGGED in order to make the Republicans, and ME, look bad.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He produced no evidence for these allegations and insisted that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/useconomy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US economy}}}\uc2  was, in fact, \u8220\'20\'1CBOOMING\u8221\'20\'1D on his watch.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/trump-fires-erika-mcentarfer-labor-statistics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Trump moves nuclear submarines after ex-Russia leader\u8217\'20\'19s menacing tweet\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  has said that he deployed nuclear-capable submarines to the \u8220\'20\'1Cappropriate regions\u8221\'20\'1D in response to a threatening tweet by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/russia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Russia}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s former president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/dmitry-medvedev"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dmitry Medvedev}}}\uc2 , suggesting that he would be ready to launch a nuclear strike as tensions rise over the war in Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 In a post on Truth Social on Friday, Trump wrote that he had decided to reposition the nuclear submarines because of \u8220\'20\'1Chighly provocative statements\u8221\'20\'1D by Medvedev, noting he was now the deputy chair of Russia\u8217\'20\'19s security council.\par \par \uc2 Medvedev had earlier said that Trump\u8217\'20\'19s threats to sanction Russia and a recent ultimatum were \u8220\'20\'1Ca threat and a step towards war\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/trump-nuclear-submarines-russia-ukraine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Dozens of countries scramble to cope with latest tariffs\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  unleashed global chaos with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/full-list-tariffs-country-rate-donald-trump-executive-order"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sweeping new tariff rates}}}\uc2 , triggering a wave of market jitters and fears for jobs in some of the poorest countries, as rates were signed off ranging from 10% to 50%.\par \par \uc2 There was a minor reprieve that opened the door to further negotiations, after the White House said the updated tariffs would take effect on 7 August, not on Friday, the deadline previously set by Trump.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/01/dozens-of-countries-scramble-to-cope-with-latest-wave-of-trump-trade-tariffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Trump steps up attacks on Fed\u8217\'20\'19s independence amid interest rates row\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  called on top \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  officials to seize control from its chair, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/jerome-powell"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jerome Powell}}}\uc2 , if he fails to cut interest rates, stepping up his extraordinary attacks on the central bank\u8217\'20\'19s independence.\par \par \uc2 The US president called Powell \u8220\'20\'1Ca stubborn MORON\u8221\'20\'1D in a series of critical social media posts on Friday, days after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/jun/18/federal-reserve-interest-rate-announcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fed held rates steady}}}\uc2  for the fifth consecutive time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/01/trump-jerome-powell-tariffs-federal-reserve"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Americans blame Trump for high cost of living, says poll\par \par \uc2 Americans are struggling financially, grappling with debt and the rising cost of living, and are blaming the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  and corporate interests for worsening economic outlooks for working families, according to a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tcf.org/content/report/the-hidden-costs-of-trumps-economy-skipped-meals-rising-debt-and-the-impossible-choices-facing-american-families/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 poll}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/01/trump-inflation-cost-of-living-poll"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Climate report a \u8216\'20\'18farce\u8217\'20\'19 full of misinformation, scientists say\par \par \uc2 A new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  report that attempts to justify a mass rollback of environmental regulations is chock-full of climate misinformation, experts say.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/trump-epa-climate-change-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 What else happened today:\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/aug/01/jobs-report-july-trump-tariffs-trade-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The US economy added 73,000 jobs in July, far lower than expected}}}\par \par \uc2 , amid ongoing concerns over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/31/trump-extends-deadline-tariff-deal-mexico"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 escalating}}}\uc2  trade war.\par \par \uc2 * Poverty and hunger will rise as a result of the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/snap-food-stamps-trump-cuts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unprecedented cuts to the US federal \u8220\'20\'1Cfood stamps\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  program, according to experts. Low-income workers who rely on the aid are braced for dire consequences.\par \par \uc2 * California\u8217\'20\'19s governor, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/gavin-newsom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gavin Newsom}}}\uc2 , may call a special election in November to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/gavin-newsom-special-election-california-redistricting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 begin the process of redrawing the state\u8217\'20\'19s congressional maps}}}\uc2  in response to Texas\u8217\'20\'19s plans to change its own maps to help {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Republicans}}}\uc2  keep their majority in the House of Representatives.\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ghislaine-maxwell"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ghislaine Maxwell}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Jeffrey Epstein\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s associate who\par \par \uc2 is currently\par \par \uc2 serving a 20-year prison sentence for sex-trafficking crimes, has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/ghislaine-maxwell-prison-transfer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transferred from a federal prison in Florida to a lower-security facility in Texas}}}\uc2 , the \uc2 US Bureau of Prisons\uc2  said on Friday.\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2  has said\par \par \uc2 she currently\par \par \uc2 has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/kamala-harris-politics-colbert"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 no desire to re-enter \u8220\'20\'1Cthe system\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/kamala-harris-politics-colbert"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  of American politics because it is \u8220\'20\'1Cbroken\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/states-sue-trump-administration-transgender-youth-healthcare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sixteen states are suing the Trump administration to defend transgender youth healthcare access}}}\par \par \uc2 , which has rapidly eroded across the US due to threats from the federal government.\par \par \uc2 Catching up? Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/01/trump-news-at-a-glance-president-unleashes-slew-of-new-tariff-rates-for-trading-partners-and-sets-another-deadline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  31 July 2025}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250802el820005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
