\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 EPA\uc2  eliminates research and development office and begins layoffs\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff and agencies \par \uc2 691 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 July 2025\par 03:19 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Administration\u8217\'20\'19s move to cut thousands of agency jobs will be devastating for US public health, union warns\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Environmental Protection Agency\uc2  (\uc2 EPA\uc2 ) said on Friday that it is eliminating its research and development arm and reducing agency staff by thousands of employees. One union leader said the moves \u8220\'20\'1Cwill devastate public health in our country\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The agency\u8217\'20\'19s office of research and development (ORD) has long provided the scientific underpinnings for the \uc2 EPA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s mission to protect the environment and human health. The \uc2 EPA\uc2  said in May it would shift its scientific expertise and research efforts to program offices that focus on major issues such as air and water.\par \par \uc2 The agency said on Friday it is creating a new office of applied science and environmental solutions that will allow it to focus on research and science \u8220\'20\'1Cmore than ever before\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Once fully implemented, the changes will save the \uc2 EPA\uc2  nearly $750m, officials said.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/19/trump-epa-pollution-regulation-cuts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s EPA aims to cut pollution rules projected to save nearly 200,000 lives: \u8216\'20\'18People will be hurt\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Representative \uc2 Zoe Lofgren\uc2  of California, the top Democrat on the House science committee, called the elimination of the research office \u8220\'20\'1Ca travesty\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Trump administration is firing hardworking scientists while employing political appointees whose job it is to lie incessantly to Congress and to the American people,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CThe obliteration of ORD will have generational impacts on Americans\u8217\'20\'19 health and safety.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 EPA\uc2  administrator Lee Zeldin said in a statement that the changes announced Friday would ensure the agency \u8220\'20\'1Cis better equipped than ever to deliver on our core mission of protecting human health and the environment, while Powering the Great American Comeback\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 EPA\uc2  also said it is beginning the process to eliminate thousands of jobs, following asupreme court ruling last week that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/08/supreme-court-trump-federal-layoffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cleared the way}}}\uc2  for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s plans to downsize the federal workforce, despite warnings that critical government services will be lost and hundreds of thousands of federal employees will be out of their jobs.\par \par \uc2 Total staffing at \uc2 EPA\uc2  will go down to 12,448, a reduction of more than 3,700 employees, or nearly 23%, from staffing levels in January when the US president took office, the agency said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis reduction in force will ensure we can better fulfill that mission while being responsible stewards of your hard-earned tax dollars,\u8221\'20\'1D Zeldin said, using a government term for mass firings.\par \par \uc2 The office of research and development \u8220\'20\'1Cis the heart and brain of the \uc2 EPA\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D, said Justin Chen, president of American Federation of Government Employees Council 238, which represents thousands of \uc2 EPA\uc2  employees.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWithout it, we don\u8217\'20\'19t have the means to assess impacts upon human health and the environment,\u8221\'20\'1D Chen said. \u8220\'20\'1CIts destruction will devastate public health in our country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The research office \u8211\'20\'13 \uc2 EPA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s main science arm \u8211\'20\'13 currently has 1,540 positions, excluding special government employees and public health officers, according to agency documents reviewed by Democratic staff on the House science panel earlier this year. As many as 1,155 chemists, biologists, toxicologists and other scientists could be laid off, the documents indicated.\par \par \uc2 The research office has 10 facilities across the country, stretching from Florida and North Carolina to Oregon. An \uc2 EPA\uc2  spokesperson said that all laboratory functions currently conducted by the research office will continue.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the reduction in force, the agency also is offering the third round of deferred resignations for eligible employees, including research office staff, spokeswoman Molly Vaseliou said. The application period is open until 25 July.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 EPA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s announcement comes two weeks after the agency put on administrative leave 139 employees who signed a \u8220\'20\'1Cdeclaration of dissent\u8221\'20\'1D with agency policies under the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2 . The agency accused the employees of \u8220\'20\'1Cunlawfully undermining\u8221\'20\'1D Trump\u8217\'20\'19s agenda.\par \par \uc2 In a letter made public on 30June, the employees wrote that the \uc2 EPA\uc2  is no longer living up to its mission to protect human health and the environment. The letter represented rare public criticism from agency employees who knew they could face retaliation for speaking out.\par \par \uc2 Associated Press contributed to reporting\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250721el7l000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
