\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Farm worker who died after California Ice raid was \u8216\'20\'18hardworking and innocent\u8217\'20\'19, family says\b0\par\par\uc2 Dani Anguiano and agencies \par \uc2 503 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 July 2025\par 09:28 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Jaime Alan\u237\'00\'EDs, 57, died a day after falling off a greenhouse roof during an immigration raid of a cannabis farm\par \par \uc2 The farm worker who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/11/california-farm-immigration-raid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 died}}}\uc2  from injuries he sustained after falling from a greenhouse roof during an Ice raid of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/california"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 California}}}\uc2  cannabis farm was a \u8220\'20\'1Chard-working, innocent farmer\u8221\'20\'1D and the sole provider for his wife and daughter, his family says.\par \par \uc2 Jaime Alan\u237\'00\'EDs died a day after a frenzied immigration raid of Glass House Farms in Ventura county where authorities arrested at least 200 workers. The 57-year-old, who was from the town of Huaj\u250\'00\'FAmbaro in Michoac\u225\'00\'E1n, Mexico, is the first known person to die during the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s enhanced immigration enforcement operations in southern California.\par \par \uc2 The federal government\u8217\'20\'19s ramped up enforcement activities have brought chaos across southern California as Ice agents descend on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/07/los-angeles-park-federal-officers-national-guard"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 parks}}}\uc2 , car washes and farms. The operations \u8211\'20\'13 and the mobilization of US military \u8211\'20\'13 have sparked widespread outrage and protests as authorities arrest a growing number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/24/trump-immigrants-ice-arrests"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 immigrants with no criminal history}}}\uc2 , despite the administration\u8217\'20\'19s claims that its primary concern was \u8220\'20\'1Cviolent criminals\u8221\'20\'1D. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/26/immigration-ice-raid-andrea-velez"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US citizens}}}\uc2  have also been swept up in the raids.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Department of Homeland Security\uc2  said it executed criminal search warrants on Thursday in Camarillo and Carpinteria, California, at facilities of Glass House Farms, which grows cannabis, tomatoes and cucumbers. Agents arrested hundreds of people suspected in being in the country without legal statuses and identified at least 10 immigrant children.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/13/los-angeles-ice-raids-terror"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Troops, terror and tears in Los Angeles as Ice raids show no sign of slowing}}}\par \par \uc2 During the raid Alan\u237\'00\'EDs called his family to say he was hiding and possibly fleeing agents before he fell about 30ft (9 metres) from the roof, according to information from family, hospital and government sources. Family members said he suffered catastrophic injuries \u8211\'20\'13 including a broken neck, fractured skull and severed artery \u8211\'20\'13 during the \u8220\'20\'1Creckless\u8221\'20\'1D raid.\par \par \uc2 Alan\u237\'00\'EDs was never in Customs and Border Protection or Ice custody, \uc2 Tricia McLaughlin\uc2 , the DHS assistant secretary for public affairs, said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CAlthough he was not being pursued by law enforcement, this individual climbed up to the roof of a greenhouse and fell 30 feet. CBP immediately called a medivac to the scene to get him care as quickly as possible.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Alan\u237\'00\'EDs had worked at Glass House for a decade and was \u8220\'20\'1Chis family\u8217\'20\'19s only provider\u8221\'20\'1D, according to a \uc2 GoFundMe\uc2  fundraiser by his niece, Yesenia Duran.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy uncle Jaime was just a hard-working, innocent farmer. He has his wife and daughter waiting for him,\u8221\'20\'1D Duran wrote.\par \par \uc2 United Farm Workers\uc2  pledged to assist the family.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur hearts are heavy for the grieving family of Jaime Alan\u237\'00\'EDs, who died from injuries sustained during a chaotic raid on Thursday,\u8221\'20\'1D the advocacy group said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ll do everything we can to support them. We continue to work with hundreds of farm worker families navigating the aftermath of this violent raid.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250715el7f001b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
FF
