\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Supreme court lifts order blocking Trump\u8217\'20\'19s federal layoffs, paving way for mass job cuts \u8211\'20\'13 as it happened\b0\par\par\uc2 Cecilia Nowell; Aben\u233\'00\'E9 Clayton, Lucy Campbell, Joseph Gedeon, Fran Lawther and Tom Ambrose \par \uc2 9,362 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 July 2025\par 02:14 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This liveblog is now closed.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 <a href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/09/trump-administration-news-today">Trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/09/trump-administration-news-today">Trump}}}\uc2  news at a glance</a>\par \par \uc2 2025-07-09T01:57:15.999Z">2.57am BST\par \par \uc2 Closing summary\par \par \uc2 Closing summary\par \par \uc2 Our live coverage is ending now. In the meantime, you can find all of our live US politics coverage {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 . Here is a summary of the key developments from today:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  met with Israeli prime minister \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2  once again today in a closed-door meeting regarding Gaza. Earlier in the day, Netanyahu met JD Vance at Blair House, and Qatari officials visited the White House. A temporary ceasefire agreement in Gaza could be finalized by the end of the week, Trump\u8217\'20\'19s Middle East envoy, \uc2 Steve Witkoff\uc2 , said at a cabinet meeting.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The supreme court cleared the way for \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s administration to resume carrying out mass job cuts and the restructuring of agencies. Liberal Justice \uc2 Ketanji Brown Jackson\uc2  was the sole member of the court to dissent. The decision will allow planned workforce reductions to resume at the US departments of agriculture, commerce, health and human services, state, treasury, veterans affairs and more than a dozen other agencies.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Despite receiving permission from the Trump administration to hire more employees, the National Weather Service never posted 126 vacancies to the federal government\u8217\'20\'19s hiring website, Politico {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/07/08/national-weather-service-help-wanted-ads-not-posted-00442033"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2 . The news follows Democrats asking a government watchdog to investigate whether cuts at the forecasting agency affected its performance.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 At a cabinet meeting today, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  said that he is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot happy\u8221\'20\'1D with Russian president \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 . The news follows the president\u8217\'20\'19s announcement that the US will resume weapons shipments to Ukraine, after the Pentagon ordered certain shipments paused. \uc2 Guardian\uc2  reporter Hugo Lowell today {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/08/us-pentagon-military-plans-patriot-missile-interceptor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that the United States only has about 25% of the Patriot missile interceptors it needs for all of the Pentagon\u8217\'20\'19s military plans after burning through stockpiles in the Middle East in recent months.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 An unknown fraudster has used artificial intelligence to impersonate the US secretary of state, \uc2 Marco Rubio\uc2  , contacting at least five senior officials.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Rightwing influencers in the US who are often aligned with{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Trump}}}\uc2  are angry that a joint justice department and \uc2 FBI{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.documentcloud.org/documents/25992101/epstein.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 memo}}}\uc2  has dismissed the existence of a \u8220\'20\'1Cclient list\u8221\'20\'1D in the case against late sex offender {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/jeffrey-epstein"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jeffrey Epstein}}}\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US government\uc2  will ban sales of US farmland to Chinese buyers and other foreign adversaries, the agriculture secretary, \uc2 Brooke Rollins\uc2  , announced today.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 New York City mayor \uc2 Eric Adams\uc2  faces lawsuits filed today by four former high-ranking police officers accusing the embattled Democrat of promoting corruption in the police department, the \uc2 New York Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/08/nyregion/nypd-corruption-lawsuits-adams.html?smid=nytcore-ios-share&referringSource=articleShare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Eight men have been deported to South Sudan from the United States, following a supreme court ruling last month allowing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  to deport migrants to countries not their own. Only one is from South Sudan.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 In a post on his social media platform, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump}}}\uc2  said his administration will release \u8220\'20\'1Ca minimum of 7\u8221\'20\'1D announcements regarding trade with other countries tomorrow.\par \par \uc2 2025-07-09T01:26:57.967Z">2.26am BST\par \par \uc2 State department to resume layoffs following supreme court ruling\par \par \uc2 The state department will resume layoffs following the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s ruling today on the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s plan to downsize the federal government.\par \par \uc2 In a social media post, the agency, 