\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Texas capitol evacuated after officials warn lawmakers of \u8216\'20\'18credible threats\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Edward Helmore \par \uc2 474 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 June 2025\par 18:18 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Alert to politicians and staffers in Austin issued hours after one Minnesota Democrat was killed and another injured\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/texas"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Texas}}}\uc2  department of public safety warned state lawmakers and legislative staffers of \u8220\'20\'1Ccredible threats\u8221\'20\'1D to their safety, hours after two {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/14/minnesota-lawmakers-shooting-explainer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Minnesota politicians were targeted}}}\uc2  early on Saturday.\par \par \uc2 An {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/TxDPS/status/1933968645681451515"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alert was issued just before 1pm}}}\uc2  local time, alerting legislators planning to attend a \u8220\'20\'1CNo Kings\u8221\'20\'1D anti-Trump rally at the capitol in Austin. The area was evacuated soon after, according to the Texas Tribune, which first obtained a copy of the warning.\par \par \uc2 The alert said the state capitol had been evacuated \u8220\'20\'1Cout of an abundance of caution\u8221\'20\'1D after the DPS received a \u8220\'20\'1Ccredible threat\u8221\'20\'1D against state lawmakers. Both the capitol building and surrounding grounds were closed temporarily, and officials did not immediately indicate when they would be reopened.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDPS continues working with our law enforcement partners to address the threat,\u8221\'20\'1D the statement said.\par \par \uc2 Later Saturday, spokesperson Ericka Miller said in a statement the department had arrested one person in connection with threats made to state lawmakers after a traffic stop in La Grange.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA short time ago, a Trooper with the \uc2 Texas Department of Public Safety\uc2  (DPS) took one person into custody in connection with the threats made against state lawmakers who planned to attend today\u8217\'20\'19s protest at the Texas State Capitol Complex,\u8221\'20\'1D Miller said.\par \par \uc2 DPS said there is no additional active threat. <aside class="element element-rich-link element--thumbnail">\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/14/minnesota-lawmakers-shooting-explainer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The attacks on Democratic lawmakers in Minnesota: what we know}}}\uc2  </aside>\par \par \uc2 That came after the state\u8217\'20\'19s lieutenant governor, \uc2 Dan Patrick\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LtGovTX/status/1933984098499928419"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted on social media}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Ca credible threat was made to possibly kill members of the Texas legislature at the capitol. \u8220\'20\'1CI urge everyone to take appropriate precautions and heed the warning of the Texas department of public safety until that threat is no longer active.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Patrick noted the killings of the Minnesota Democratic state representative \uc2 Melissa Hortman\uc2  and her husband, saying that what happened \u8220\'20\'1Cin Minnesota is a tragedy and our prayers go out to the families, friends, and those impacted\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Saturday\u8217\'20\'19s protest in Austin, which organizers have said will be nonviolent, is sponsored by the chair of the Texas house Democratic caucus, Gene Wu. The Democratic state representative John Bucy III, the Democratic state senator Sarah Eckhardt and the Democratic representative Greg Casar were expected to attend.\par \par \uc2 Republican representative Charlie Geren later told colleagues in an email that the Minnesota suspect \u8211\'20\'13 identified by police as Vance Boelter, 57 \u8211\'20\'13 had a list of potential targets.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt seems to be an isolated incident. However, we\u8217\'20\'19re always concerned about copycats and those who the attack might inspire,\u8221\'20\'1D Geren wrote. \u8220\'20\'1CYour safety is our top priority, and we are taking all necessary precautions to address any potential threats.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250614el6e002s1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
