\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Acting head of US employment rights agency failing to protect trans and nonbinary workers, Democrats say\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 446 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 June 2025\par 02:04 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Letter alleges that \uc2 Equal Employment Opportunity Commission\uc2  \u8216\'20\'18abdicated responsibility under the law\u8217\'20\'19\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/democrats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats}}}\uc2  are demanding the acting chair of the \uc2 Equal Employment Opportunity Commission\uc2  enforce civil rights protections for transgender and nonbinary people.\par \par \uc2 A letter to Andrea Lucas, a copy of which was viewed by the Guardian, alleges the agency has \u8220\'20\'1Cabdicated this responsibility under the law when it comes to transgender and nonbinary workers\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The letter cites that shortly after Lucas\u8217\'20\'19s appointment as acting chair of the \uc2 EEOC\uc2  in January 2025, Lucas instructed the agency to halt the processing of claims related to gender identity discrimination, and that in April 2025 the agency instructed all employees to classify gender identity discrimination complaints as its lowest priority.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA categorization reserved for meritless charges \u8211\'20\'13 which essentially puts the processing of such complaints in an indefinite hold,\u8221\'20\'1D the letter states.\par \par \uc2 The letter also notes the \uc2 EEOC\uc2  moved to dismiss six cases the agency had previously pursued against employers accused of gender identity discrimination, including EEOC v Boxwood Hotels, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.eeoc.gov/newsroom/eeoc-sues-boxwood-and-related-hotel-franchises-discriminating-against-transgender-employee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuit}}}\uc2  in which the employer is alleged to have fired a transgender employee after the employee\u8217\'20\'19s manager repeatedly misgendered the employee and referred to them as \u8220\'20\'1Cit\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Signers of the letter include 70 members of Congress, led by Congressman Mark Takano, Robert C \u8220\'20\'1CBobby\u8221\'20\'1D Scott and Suzanne Bonamici. The letter comes as state legislatures in the US introduced {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.americanprogress.org/article/the-lgbtqi-community-reported-high-rates-of-discrimination-in-2024/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over 530 bills}}}\uc2  targeting LGBTQ+ people in 2024.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 EEOC\uc2  also removed the \u8220\'20\'1Cx\u8221\'20\'1D gender marker on intake forms, removed materials on rights and protections on gender identity discrimination, and issued a memorandum informing fair employment practices agencies that they will not receive credit for intakes or resolutions related to gender identity, the letter added.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAlarmingly, in both the commission\u8217\'20\'19s filings in court and in your previous statements, you have invoked President Trump\u8217\'20\'19s sweeping executive order, which states it is the policy of the federal government to only recognize two sexes and seeks to have all agencies refuse to acknowledge the existence of transgender people,\u8221\'20\'1D the letter continued.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe commission is supposed to be an independent agency, and as a commissioner and its acting chair, your job is to enforce the law. The supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s ruling in Bostock is the law of the land, and the commission\u8217\'20\'19s previous cases, including Macy v Holder, Jameson v US postal service and Lusardi v Department of the Army, are binding precedents on the agency. An executive order cannot overturn any of those precedents or the commission\u8217\'20\'19s obligations and responsibilities under the Civil Rights Act of 1964.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250613el6d002be\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
